			"name": "Cell Division",
			"tooltip": "Each time Zac hits an enemy with an Ability, he sheds a chunk of <keywordMajor>Goo</keywordMajor> that can be reabsorbed to restore <healing>@HealPercent@ Max Health</healing>.<br><br>Upon dying, Zac splits into 4 bloblets that attempt to recombine. If any bloblets remain after <scaleLevel>@ReviveBlobletDuration@</scaleLevel> seconds, he will revive with 10-50% Health based on the surviving bloblet's Health. This has a @ReviveCooldown@ second Cooldown.",
			"tooltipExtended": "{{Spell_ZacPassiveChunkDrop_Tooltip}}<br><br><rules>Each bloblet has 12% of Zac's max <healing>Health</healing>, and 50% of his <scaleArmor>Armor</scaleArmor> and <scaleMR>Magic Resist</scaleMR>.</rules>"
